    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-449681"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5e20501eb5771b0ca4420980"
                id="word_commented_5e20501eb5771b0ca4420980"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e20501eb5771b0ca4420980">
                    王影洲
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">13/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449681"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL243068https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL243068at13%2FMay%2F251%3A43PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-43068" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-43068</a> at 13/May/25 1:43 PM</h5>

<p>平台上两台GPU虚机处于关机从状态无法启动, 启动时报如下错误</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/354560" alt="image-20250513-054207.png" height="643" width="1180" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p>重置状态再次重启还是报同样的错误</p>

<p>另外再节点上新建gpu虚机也会报同样的错误</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-449682"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5dff08655361330daae9584e"
                id="word_commented_5dff08655361330daae9584e"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5dff08655361330daae9584e">
                    esoncall
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">13/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449682"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><font color="#ff5630"><b>Attention: Priority Detail和Priority的设置不一致，根据Priority Detail调整Priority！！！</b></font></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-449698"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="61e6481ffd5a690068b96066"
                id="word_commented_61e6481ffd5a690068b96066"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=61e6481ffd5a690068b96066">
                    周众
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">13/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449698"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>直接原因是环境里的daemonset访问k8s都有权限问题，包括vmm、dm、nova-compute等等，vmm因为权限问题没查到vgpu cr，导致json解析异常。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/354617" alt="企业微信截图_f2e1e558-fa40-4d95-bc6c-b828a1a5d3f4-20250513-073208.png" height="240" width="862" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-449699"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="61e6481ffd5a690068b96066"
                id="word_commented_61e6481ffd5a690068b96066"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=61e6481ffd5a690068b96066">
                    周众
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">13/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449699"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=613ae984f6070d006b865bb9" class="user-hover" rel="613ae984f6070d006b865bb9" data-account-id="613ae984f6070d006b865bb9" accountid="613ae984f6070d006b865bb9" rel="noreferrer">朱桃</a> 这个环境做过如下变更，请问权限问题和这个变更有关系吗？</p>

<p>2）执行EOS节点软关机导致的coredns svc访问问题变更；和方向了控制台ip ssh权限</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-449735"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="613ae984f6070d006b865bb9"
                id="word_commented_613ae984f6070d006b865bb9"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=613ae984f6070d006b865bb9">
                    朱桃
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">13/五月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-449735"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>访问k8s时的详细输出：报错没有认证</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/354681" alt="image-20250513-102123.png" height="416" width="1130" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>查看 k8s apiserver日志：报错token无效</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/354680" alt="企业微信截图_6f0c1684-c2c4-46a3-8f5b-60f7b4ac7411-20250513-102635.png" height="421" width="1132" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>获取了一个nova-computer的token如下：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjJITFZscnBsTzZlMm9fS3ZEakxibmY4NWRHbHZJZlNKWmk3TXpaV1JGeU0ifQ..j4G9J1lY7He7vBcjL3F5mVkAyttYn5UHTw5kHZI8Nn836KuJKAtHWC4yz1-GkUVn-jlGKaB2I5ovAmmWYLyFlagYqAh9jL2EqEl_-ravZiurAK72Lf7IjkUvCJ-C6kGExCxx7VHjMHAWVoXq713V46rLY4xg3su_Vjt9upE08WtAvUemAxVyFoNXTibYaZBIYRxaaZICLi_BMFzjYUNE8w79MRd7LjbO_Q3tKn7ZizrRRHW0XGZ7ZRQz5xfN-urqhfA-GnT1FNtQ9XsJXTS8sPWzjoGe7Gwee7hGUOMGTLfTVRv63d7MobFFFJXi_jCGLu6Z71j3PGIY6oSOiSobqA</pre>
</div></div>

